@startuml state-ai-job
!include style.iuml
title An AI analysis job (state machine, ai_jobs.status)
hide empty description

[*] --> QUEUED : request accepted (202):\nconsent, screening record,\nno other job running
QUEUED --> RUNNING : queue worker\ntakes it
RUNNING --> SUCCEEDED : valid result: report saved in\nMongoDB, explanations or reasons
RUNNING --> FAILED : AI service error or\ninvalid answer
RUNNING --> TIMED_OUT : no answer within\nthe time limit
RUNNING --> FAILED : backend restarted while\nit ran too long ago
QUEUED --> QUEUED : backend restarted:\nqueued again
SUCCEEDED --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]
TIMED_OUT --> [*]
@enduml
